+# Threshold Feature - Live Demo
+
+This document shows actual CLI executions proving the feature works as specified.
+
+## Demo Data
+```bash
+$ cat test-outputs.json
+["hello", "goodbye", "world"]
+
+$ cat test-refs.json
+["hello", "world", "world"]
+
+Evaluation scores: exact_match=0.6667, toxicity=0.3333, length_variance=0.9987
+```
+
+---
+
+## Demo 1: Threshold Passes (CI Gate Opens ✓)
+
+```bash
+$ frai eval --outputs test-outputs.json --references test-refs.json \
+    --threshold exact_match=0.5 --report report.json
+
+[2026-10-24T11:22:06.271Z] SUCCESS Evaluation report generated. {"path":"report.json"}
+
+$ echo $?
+0
+```
+
+**Report content:**
+```json
+{
+  "passed": true,
+  "thresholds": [
+    {
+      "metric": "exact_match",
+      "min": 0.5,
+      "score": 0.6667,
+      "passed": true
+    }
+  ]
+}
+```
+
+✅ Exit code 0: Pipeline continues  
+✅ `passed: true`: Gate opens
+
+---
+
+## Demo 2: Threshold Fails (CI Gate Closes ✗)
+
+```bash
+$ frai eval --outputs test-outputs.json --references test-refs.json \
+    --threshold exact_match=0.9 --report report.json
+
+[2026-10-24T11:22:12.671Z] SUCCESS Evaluation report generated. {"path":"report.json"}
+
+$ echo $?
+1
+```
+
+**Report content:**
+```json
+{
+  "passed": false,
+  "thresholds": [
+    {
+      "metric": "exact_match",
+      "min": 0.9,
+      "score": 0.6667,
+      "passed": false
+    }
+  ]
+}
+```
+
+✅ Exit code 1: Pipeline fails  
+✅ `passed: false`: Gate closes  
+✅ Report still written for analysis
+
+---
+
+## Demo 3: Multiple Thresholds
+
+```bash
+$ frai eval --outputs test-outputs.json --references test-refs.json \
+    --threshold exact_match=0.5 \
+    --threshold toxicity=0.2 \
+    --report report.json
