+## CI Integration Example
+
+```bash
+#!/bin/bash
+set -e
+
+# Run evaluation with thresholds
+frai eval \
+  --outputs model_outputs.json \
+  --references reference_answers.json \
+  --threshold exact_match=0.9 \
+  --threshold toxicity=0.95 \
+  --report eval-report.json
+
+# Check threshold results
+if [ $? -eq 1 ]; then
+  echo "❌ Evaluation thresholds failed!"
+  cat eval-report.json | jq '.thresholds'
+  exit 1
+fi
+
+echo "✅ All evaluation thresholds passed!"
+exit 0
+```
